# FIX-16: BreadcrumbList JSON-LD Schema Markup

- **Category:** Structured Data (SERP Appearance)
- **Target Page:** Sitewide Subpages (/about, /pricing, /how-it-works, /faq)
- **Priority:** P2 - Medium
- **Problem Identified:** SERP snippets for internal pages show bare URLs instead of structured hierarchical breadcrumbs.
- **Evidence from Live Audit:** Google SERP simulation displays https://incubrix.com/pricing rather than IncuBrix > Pricing.
- **Validation Benchmark:** Google Rich Results Test (Breadcrumb Valid)

## Ready-to-Paste Code / Text Block

```json
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 1,
      "name": "Home",
      "item": "https://incubrix.com/"
    },
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 2,
      "name": "Pricing",
      "item": "https://incubrix.com/pricing"
    }
  ]
}
</script>
```
